title: KeePass Trigger Export Abuse
id: 97b7a817-8952-4ddc-8375-20213b90ac1f
status: experimental
description: Detects modification of the KeePass configuration to add an export trigger (KeePass.config.xml with a Trigger that exports the database to CSV/XML), a technique to silently dump a KeePass vault to cleartext.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1555/005/
logsource:
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: 'KeePass.config'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'Trigger'
      - 'Export'
      - 'ExportActiveDatabase'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate KeePass trigger configuration
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1555.005
